<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>python Utilities on Winner's Dev Notes</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/categories/python-utilities/</link><description>Recent content in python Utilities on Winner's Dev Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2024 20:48:47 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://releaseleaf.com/categories/python-utilities/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Find Images Larger Than 500 KB Recursively with python</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/fiimlathkb.html</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2024 20:48:47 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/fiimlathkb.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Large images in an exported web project can increase loading time. This script recursively scans a directory and writes paths for images larger than 500 KB to &lt;code&gt;large_images.txt&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt; 1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-2"&gt; 2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-3"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-3"&gt; 3&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-4"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-4"&gt; 4&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-5"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-5"&gt; 5&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-6"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-6"&gt; 6&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-7"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-7"&gt; 7&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-8"&gt;&lt;a clas